    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "35b2635a1f7657662303": "Ya may not follow the ways of the Light like a Knight of the Silver Hand, but ya can always ask us for aid.",
        "9aaf1d830c88375a3b65": "The Light be with ya, $c. How can I help ya?",
        "9d3101cc51bc875da50f": "I would like to train further in the ways of the Light.",
        "a0d771dae13dae43299f": "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"
      },
      "name": "Bromos Grummner",
      "subName": "Paladin Trainer",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
          "dialogue.35b2635a1f7657662303": {
